# React Patterns

- Vite + React + Tailwind. Functional components only.
- API access only through `src/api/client.ts`.
- Live updates via `useSSE`; pipeline state via `usePipeline`.
- HITL actions go through `useApproval` → POST `/signals/{id}`.
- Keep DagView driven by server stage status, not local simulation.
